Note: Create a DFD for the Student Enrollment System described above. Your DFD should
include the following components:
● Processes: Represent processes such as "Course Enrollment," "View Schedule,"
"Check Grades," "Register Course," and "Calculate Grades."
● Data Stores: Include data stores for "Student Information," "Course Schedule,"
"Course Enrollment," and "Grade Records."
● External Entities: Represent external entities such as "Student" and "Faculty."
● Data Flows: Clearly illustrate the flow of data between processes, data stores, and
external entities.
